{
 "regions": {
  "r3": {
   "type": "translation",
   "lines": [
    {
     "n": 1,
     "text": "long as you live; if you shall slay in battle the",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "n": 2,
     "text": "sons of Pandu, O you of Kuru’a race, I will",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "n": 3,
     "text": "retire into the woods with the permission of",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "n": 4,
     "text": "Duryodhana.",
     "end": "space"
    }
   ],
   "uncertain": false,
   "note": null
  },
  "r4": {
   "type": "verse",
   "lines": [
    {
     "n": 1,
     "text": "पाण्डवैर्वा हते भीष्म त्वयि स्वर्गमुपेयुषि।",
     "end": "line"
    },
    {
     "n": 2,
     "text": "हन्तास्म्येकरथेनैव कृत्स्नान् यान् मन्यसे रथान्॥४०॥",
     "end": "space"
    }
   ],
   "uncertain": false,
   "note": null
  },
  "r5": {
   "type": "translation",
   "lines": [
    {
     "n": 1,
     "text": "If, O Bhisma, on the contrary, you, being",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "n": 2,
     "text": "slain by the Pandavas, are transported to",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "n": 3,
     "text": "heaven, then will I, riding on a single car, slay",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "n": 4,
     "text": "those whom you consider to be the mightiest of",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "n": 5,
     "text": "all car-warriors.",
     "end": "space"
    }
   ],
   "uncertain": false,
   "note": null
  },
  "r6": {
   "type": "verse",
   "lines": [
    {
     "n": 1,
     "text": "एवमुक्त्वा महाबाहुर्दशाहानि महायशाः।",
     "end": "line"
    },
    {
     "n": 2,
     "text": "नायुध्यत ततः कर्णः पुत्रस्य तव सम्मते॥४१॥",
     "end": "space"
    }
   ],
   "uncertain": false,
   "note": null
  },
  "r7": {
   "type": "translation",
   "lines": [
    {
     "n": 1,
     "text": "Having thus spoken, the mighty-armed",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "n": 2,
     "text": "Karna of illustrious renown, refrained, with the",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "n": 3,
     "text": "permission of your son, from taking part in the",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "n": 4,
     "text": "battle for these ten days.",
     "end": "space"
    }
   ],
   "uncertain": false,
   "note": null
  },
  "r8": {
   "type": "verse",
   "lines": [
    {
     "n": 1,
     "text": "भीष्मः समरविक्रान्तः पाण्डवेयस्य भारत।",
     "end": "line"
    },
    {
     "n": 2,
     "text": "जघान समरे योधानसंख्येयपराक्रमः॥४२॥",
     "end": "space"
    }
   ],
   "uncertain": false,
   "note": null
  },
  "r9": {
   "type": "translation",
   "lines": [
    {
     "n": 1,
     "text": "O Bharata, Bhishma of immeasurable",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "n": 2,
     "text": "prowess, displaying his might in battle, slew a",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "n": 3,
     "text": "large number of warriors of the Pandava host",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "n": 4,
     "text": "in that (sanguinary) engagement.",
     "end": "space"
    }
   ],
   "uncertain": false,
   "note": null
  },
  "r10": {
   "type": "verse",
   "lines": [
    {
     "n": 1,
     "text": "तस्मिंस्तु निहते शूरे सत्यसंधे महौजसि।",
     "end": "line"
    },
    {
     "n": 2,
     "text": "त्वत्सुताः कर्णमस्मार्षुस्तर्तुकामा इव प्लवम्॥४३॥",
     "end": "space"
    }
   ],
   "uncertain": false,
   "note": null
  },
  "r11": {
   "type": "translation",
   "lines": [
    {
     "n": 1,
     "text": "On the fall of that most powerful hero of",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "n": 2,
     "text": "unerring aim, your sons remembered Karna,",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "n": 3,
     "text": "like persons desirous of crossing (the ocean)",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "n": 4,
     "text": "remembering a raft.",
     "end": "space"
    }
   ],
   "uncertain": false,
   "note": null
  },
  "r12": {
   "type": "verse",
   "lines": [
    {
     "n": 1,
     "text": "तावकास्तव पुत्राश्च सहिताः सर्वराजभिः।",
     "end": "line"
    },
    {
     "n": 2,
     "text": "हा कर्ण इति चाक्रन्दुः कालोऽयमिति चाब्रुवन्॥४४॥",
     "end": "space"
    }
   ],
   "uncertain": false,
   "note": null
  },
  "r13": {
   "type": "translation",
   "lines": [
    {
     "n": 1,
     "text": "Your sons and the warriors of your party,",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "n": 2,
     "text": "together with the (assembled) monarchs then,",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "n": 3,
     "text": "began to bewail saying ‘Karna’ they also said",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "n": 4,
     "text": "‘It is time for you to come.’",
     "end": "space"
    }
   ],
   "uncertain": false,
   "note": null
  },
  "r14": {
   "type": "verse",
   "lines": [
    {
     "n": 1,
     "text": "एवं ते स्म हि राधेयं सूतपुत्रं तनुत्यजम्।",
     "end": "line"
    },
    {
     "n": 2,
     "text": "चुक्रुशुः सहिता योधास्तत्र तत्र महाबलाः॥४५॥",
     "end": "space"
    }
   ],
   "uncertain": false,
   "note": null
  },
  "r15": {
   "type": "translation",
   "lines": [
    {
     "n": 1,
     "text": "Thus all the warriors endued with great",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "n": 2,
     "text": "prowess, bewailed on the dead body of Karna,",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "n": 3,
     "text": "the son of Suta and Radha.",
     "end": "space"
    }
   ],
   "uncertain": false,
   "note": null
  },
  "r16": {
   "type": "verse",
   "lines": [
    {
     "n": 1,
     "text": "जामदग्न्याभ्यनुज्ञातमस्त्रे दुर्वारपौरुषम्।",
     "end": "line"
    },
    {
     "n": 2,
     "text": "आगमन्नो मनः कर्णं बन्धुमात्ययिकेष्विव॥४६॥",
     "end": "space"
    }
   ],
   "uncertain": false,
   "note": null
  },
  "r17": {
   "type": "translation",
   "lines": [
    {
     "n": 1,
     "text": "As during emergencies the heart flies to a",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "n": 2,
     "text": "friend, so our hearts then flew to Karna of",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "n": 3,
     "text": "irrepressible manhood who had acquired his",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "n": 4,
     "text": "knowledge of weapons from the son of",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "n": 5,
     "text": "Jamadagni.",
     "end": "space"
    }
   ],
   "uncertain": false,
   "note": null
  },
  "r18": {
   "type": "verse",
   "lines": [
    {
     "n": 1,
     "text": "स हि शक्तो रणे राजंस्त्रातुमस्मान् महाभयात्।",
     "end": "line"
    },
    {
     "n": 2,
     "text": "त्रिदशानिव गोविन्दः सततं सुमहाभयात्॥४७॥",
     "end": "space"
    }
   ],
   "uncertain": false,
   "note": null
  },
  "r19": {
   "type": "translation",
   "lines": [
    {
     "n": 1,
     "text": "O monarch, he only was capable of saving",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "n": 2,
     "text": "us from the great dangers of battle, like",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "n": 3,
     "text": "Govinda protecting the celestials from all",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "n": 4,
     "text": "calamities.",
     "end": "space"
    }
   ],
   "uncertain": false,
   "note": null
  },
  "r20": {
   "type": "speaker",
   "lines": [
    {
     "n": 1,
     "text": "वैशम्पायन उवाच",
     "end": "space"
    }
   ],
   "uncertain": false,
   "note": null
  },
  "r21": {
   "type": "verse",
   "lines": [
    {
     "n": 1,
     "text": "तथा तु संजयं कर्णं कीर्तयन्तं पुनः पुनः।",
     "end": "line"
    },
    {
     "n": 2,
     "text": "आशीविषदुच्छ्वस्य धृतराष्ट्रोऽब्रवीदिदम्॥४८॥",
     "end": "space"
    }
   ],
   "uncertain": false,
   "note": null
  },
  "r22": {
   "type": "speaker",
   "lines": [
    {
     "n": 1,
     "text": "Vaishampayana said",
     "end": "space"
    }
   ],
   "uncertain": false,
   "note": null
  },
  "r23": {
   "type": "translation",
   "lines": [
    {
     "n": 1,
     "text": "Thereupon breathing (heavily) out like a",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "n": 2,
     "text": "snake, Dhritarashtra spoke these words to",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "n": 3,
     "text": "Sanjaya who had been thus repeatedly",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "n": 4,
     "text": "extolling Karna.",
     "end": "space"
    }
   ],
   "uncertain": false,
   "note": null
  },
  "r24": {
   "type": "speaker",
   "lines": [
    {
     "n": 1,
     "text": "धृतराष्ट्र उवाच",
     "end": "space"
    }
   ],
   "uncertain": false,
   "note": null
  },
  "r25": {
   "type": "verse",
   "lines": [
    {
     "n": 1,
     "text": "यत् तद्वैकर्तनं कर्णमगमद् वो मनस्तदा।",
     "end": "line"
    },
    {
     "n": 2,
     "text": "अप्यपश्यत राधेयं सूतपुत्रं तनुत्यजम्॥४९॥",
     "end": "space"
    }
   ],
   "uncertain": false,
   "note": null
  },
  "r26": {
   "type": "speaker",
   "lines": [
    {
     "n": 1,
     "text": "Dhritarashtra said",
     "end": "space"
    }
   ],
   "uncertain": false,
   "note": null
  },
  "r27": {
   "type": "translation",
   "lines": [
    {
     "n": 1,
     "text": "As your heart then were drawn to wards",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "n": 2,
     "text": "Karna, the son of Vikartana, you surely saw",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "n": 3,
     "text": "that son of Radha, that descendant of Suta, who",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "n": 4,
     "text": "was ever-ready to lay down his life for you.",
     "end": "space"
    }
   ],
   "uncertain": false,
   "note": null
  },
  "r28": {
   "type": "verse",
   "lines": [
    {
     "n": 1,
     "text": "अपि तन्न मृषाकार्षीत् कच्चित् सत्यपराक्रमः।",
     "end": "line"
    },
    {
     "n": 2,
     "text": "सम्भ्रान्तानां तदार्तानां त्रस्तानां त्राणमिच्छताम्॥५०॥",
     "end": "space"
    }
   ],
   "uncertain": false,
   "note": null
  },
  "r29": {
   "type": "translation",
   "lines": [
    {
     "n": 1,
     "text": "Did that Karna, of infallible prowess in",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "n": 2,
     "text": "battle, disappoint Duryodhana and his brothers,",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "n": 3,
     "text": "who had been all exceedingly distressed, panic-",
     "end": "hyphen"
    },
    {
     "n": 4,
     "text": "struck and anxious for being extricated from",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "n": 5,
     "text": "their difficulties?",
     "end": "space"
    }
   ],
   "uncertain": false,
   "note": null
  },
  "r30": {
   "type": "verse",
   "lines": [
    {
     "n": 1,
     "text": "अपि तत् पूरयांचक्रे धनुर्धरवरो युधि।",
     "end": "line"
    },
    {
     "n": 2,
     "text": "यतद् विनिहते भीष्मे कौरवाणामपाकृतम्॥५१॥",
     "end": "space"
    }
   ],
   "uncertain": true,
   "note": "The opening word of the second line is unclear."
  },
  "r31": {
   "type": "translation",
   "lines": [
    {
     "n": 1,
     "text": "Was that foremost of bowmen in battle",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "n": 2,
     "text": "capable of filling up the void created by the fall",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "n": 3,
     "text": "of Bhishma, the shelter of the Kurus?",
     "end": "space"
    }
   ],
   "uncertain": false,
   "note": null
  },
  "r32": {
   "type": "verse",
   "lines": [
    {
     "n": 1,
     "text": "तत् खण्डं पूरयन् कर्णः परेषामादधद् भयम्।",
     "end": "line"
    },
    {
     "n": 2,
     "text": "स हि वै पुरुषव्याघ्रो लोके संजय कथ्यते॥५२॥",
     "end": "space"
    }
   ],
   "uncertain": false,
   "note": null
  },
  "r1": {
   "type": "page_number",
   "lines": [
    {
     "n": 1,
     "text": "4",
     "end": "space"
    }
   ],
   "uncertain": false,
   "note": null
  },
  "r2": {
   "type": "running_header",
   "lines": [
    {
     "n": 1,
     "text": "MAHĀBHĀRATA",
     "end": "space"
    }
   ],
   "uncertain": false,
   "note": null
  }
 },
